<http://data.silknow.org/object/f15eab35-579b-3956-87cd-3532b567038e>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Across the top are the words \"viva Gesu\" flanking a cross with the sacred monogram \"IHS\". Beneath this are alphabets and numbers in horizontal rows. The field bears floral and architectural motives, a bird on a branch and a central garland with the intitials \"M S\". Bordered all around by a simple continuous vine motif. Worked in cross stitch.  Slightly soiled; stained.  Stitches: cross, eyelet."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/0b0a4a76-b483-3c3e-b9ad-93dc40a50fb5> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Across the top are the words \"viva Gesu\" flanking a cross with the sacred monogram \"IHS\". Beneath this are alphabets and numbers in horizontal rows. The field bears floral and architectural motives, a bird on a branch and a central garland with the intitials \"M S\". Bordered all around by a simple continuous vine motif. Worked in cross stitch.  Slightly soiled; stained.  Stitches: cross, eyelet."@en ;
